# The build image with what the screenshots of the documentation and the software centres need and the UI tests of CI do not: the Breeze Qt style and window decoration (the controls and the title bar are drawn as Plasma does; the tests are tuned to the style the build image has), the KDE platform theme (Plasma's fonts, palette and icons), a nested KWin whose screenshot interface takes the window with its title bar and shadow, kscreen-doctor to give KWin's virtual output a scale of 2, Mesa for KWin's OpenGL compositing on the host's GPU, and oxipng to shrink the PNGs. Used by build/screenshots.sh only
FROM localhost/kinefin-build:fedora45
USER root
RUN dnf install -y --setopt=install_weak_deps=False kwin plasma-breeze plasma-integration libkscreen mesa-dri-drivers mesa-libEGL mesa-libgbm dbus-daemon oxipng && dnf clean all
